<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta name="description" content="A leaderboard bot for Slack. Challenge a colleague to a game, track scores and rankings, and browse public game data on PlayPlay.io.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="PlayPlay.io - Leaderboard Bot for Slack">
    <meta property="og:description" content="A leaderboard bot for Slack. Challenge a colleague to a game, track scores and rankings, and browse public game data on PlayPlay.io.">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="PlayPlay.io - Leaderboard Bot for Slack">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="A leaderboard bot for Slack. Challenge a colleague to a game, track scores and rankings, and browse public game data on PlayPlay.io.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="slack,ping,pong,ping-pong,chess,pool,billiards,tic-tac-toe,slack,bot,leaderboard">
    <title>PlayPlay.io - Leaderboard Bot for Slack</title>
    <%= partial 'public/partials/_head.html.erb' %>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
      "name": "PlayPlay.io",
      "url": "<%= SlackRubyBotServer::Service.url %>",
      "applicationCategory": "GameApplication",
      "operatingSystem": "Slack",
      "description": "A leaderboard bot for Slack. Challenge a colleague to a game, track scores and rankings, and browse public game data on PlayPlay.io."
    }
    </script>
  </head>
  <body id="page-top" class="site-page">
    <%= partial 'public/partials/_navigation.html.erb' %>
    <main id="main">
      <div id="homepage">
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
          <div class="page-container">
            <div class="hero-copy">
              <h1 id="hero-title">Keep score.</h1>
              <p class="hero-description">Challenge a colleague to ping pong, chess, or pool. Record the result and let Gamebot keep your channel's rankings up to date, right in Slack.</p>
              <div class="hero-actions">
                <%= partial 'public/partials/_install_button.html.erb' %>
                <a class="hero-link" href="#howtouse">See how it works</a>
              </div>
              <p class="trial-note">Free for two weeks. Then $49.99 per team / year.</p>
            </div>
            <figure class="hero-preview">
              <img src="<%= h asset_path('/img/slack.png') %>" width="1600" height="1000" alt="Gamebot recording a challenge, match score, and leaderboard in a Slack channel">
              <figcaption class="team-count"><span id="active_teams_count" class="tagline" style="display: none;">The leaderboard bot for startup ping pong since 2016.</span></figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="feature-section" id="howtouse" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
          <div class="page-container feature-layout">
            <div class="feature-copy">
              <h2 id="challenge-title">Challenge someone</h2>
              <p>Invite <code>@gamebot</code> to a channel, then challenge someone. Gamebot also supports doubles.</p>
            </div>
            <figure class="feature-preview">
              <img src="<%= h asset_path('/img/portfolio/challengesnapshot.png') %>" width="611" height="384" alt="Gamebot announcing a teammate's game challenge in Slack" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="feature-section" aria-labelledby="result-title">
          <div class="page-container feature-layout">
            <div class="feature-copy">
              <h2 id="result-title">Don't be a loser</h2>
              <p>Lost the game? Send <code>@gamebot lost</code>. In a draw, both players send <code>@gamebot draw</code>. Gamebot records the result and updates your rankings.</p>
            </div>
            <figure class="feature-preview">
              <img src="<%= h asset_path('/img/portfolio/resultsnapshot.png') %>" width="612" height="362" alt="A lost match recorded in Slack with a reaction saying see you losers tomorrow" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="feature-section" aria-labelledby="leaderboard-title">
          <div class="page-container feature-layout">
            <div class="feature-copy">
              <h2 id="leaderboard-title">Stay on top</h2>
              <p>Check your rank with <code>@gamebot rank</code>, or see the top ten with <code>@gamebot leaderboard 10</code>. Each channel keeps its own leaderboard.</p>
            </div>
            <figure class="feature-preview">
              <img src="<%= h asset_path('/img/portfolio/teamrankings.png') %>" width="400" height="310" alt="Gamebot's channel leaderboard showing player rankings and Elo ratings" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="pricing-section page-container" id="pricing" aria-label="Pricing">
          <div>
            <p>Try PlayPlay.io free for two weeks, then subscribe your Slack team for $49.99 a year.</p>
            <p>DM the bot <code>help</code> for your subscription link. Cancel auto-renewal any time with <code>unsubscribe</code> and the bot's confirmation instructions.</p>
            <a href="/help.html#support">Questions? We're here to help.</a>
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-action">
            <p class="section-label">Simple pricing</p>
            <p class="price"><strong>$49.99</strong><span>per team / year</span></p>
            <%= partial 'public/partials/_install_button.html.erb' %>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="project-info page-container" id="oss" aria-labelledby="source-title">
          <div>
            <h2 id="source-title">Open by design.</h2>
            <p>The bot and website are MIT-licensed Ruby code.<br><a href="https://github.com/dblock/slack-gamebot2">Explore the project on GitHub</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="api">
            <h3>Build on your game data.</h3>
            <p>Your team data is accessible using AI or code.<br><a href="https://github.com/dblock/slack-gamebot2#api">Explore the API</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section id="register" class="page-container registration-panel" style="display: none;" aria-labelledby="register-title">
        <h1 id="register-title">Connect your Slack team</h1>
        <p id="messages" role="status" aria-live="polite">Working, please wait ...</p>
        <p>Invite the bot to a channel after installation, or <a href="/">go back to PlayPlay.io</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%= partial 'public/partials/_footer.html.erb' %>
    <%= partial 'public/partials/_scripts.html.erb' %>
    <script src="<%= h asset_path('/js/register.js') %>"></script>
    <script src="<%= h asset_path('/js/status.js') %>"></script>
    <script src="<%= h asset_path('/js/uptime.js') %>"></script>
  </body>
</html>
